	(descr "Ebyte E73-2G4M08S1C (nRF52840, ceramic antenna), 13.0 x 18.0 x 3.0 mm, 43 pads: 28 castellated at 1.27 mm pitch plus 15 inner 0.8 mm pads. From the Ebyte specification section 3 drawing (bottom view mirrored to top view). Castellated lands extend 0.3 mm beyond the body. Antenna keep-out (all layers) at the +y end, which goes at the board edge; Ebyte gives no keep-out drawing.")
